.0.11), [MariaDB 10.1.0](https://app.gitbook.com/s/aEnK0ZXmUbJzqQrTjFyb/community-server/old-releases/10.1/10.1.0)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |\n| [1.1.6](https://app.gitbook.com/s/aEnK0ZXmUbJzqQrTjFyb/community-server/old-releases/mariadb-audit-plugin-release-notes) | [MariaDB 5.5.37](https://app.gitbook.com/s/aEnK0ZXmUbJzqQrTjFyb/community-server/old-releases/5.5/5.5.37), [MariaDB 10.0.10](https://app.gitbook.com/s/aEnK0ZXmUbJzqQrTjFyb/community-server/old-releases/10.0/10.0.10)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |\n| [1.1.5](https://app.gitbook.com/s/aEnK0ZXmUbJzqQrTjFyb/community-server/old-releases/mariadb-audit-plugin-release-notes) | [MariaDB 10.0.09](https://app.gitbook.com/s/aEnK0ZXmUbJzqQrTjFyb/community-server/old-releases/10.0/10.0.9)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              